  "description": "j = 2 head-divisibility criterion feeding the sorry-free Lean lemma QOU.Habiro.habiroEval_ne_zero_of_head_not_dvd. For odd p the criterion reduces to a single integer A = a_0(-1) + 2*a_1(-1) per atom: it fires — hence Frob_p != 0 — at every odd prime not dividing A. j = 1 is vacuous for odd p because 1 - zeta_{2p} is a unit there (Norm = Phi_{2p}(1) = 1 when 2p is not a prime power), which is the head_criterion_vacuous_of_isUnit case. The closed form is cross-checked against brute-force divisibility in Z[u]/Phi_{2p}(u) at 14 primes. All arithmetic is exact; no floating point is used anywhere in this script.",
